    [5201]={name="Emberstone Staff",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Captain Greenskin in The Deadmines.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Captain Greenskin"},
    [5274]={name="Rose Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Morganth'. In Redridge Mountains.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Morganth",lore="After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."},
    [5275]={name="Binding Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Disruption Ends' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Disruption Ends",lore="One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."},
    [5306]={name="Wind Rider Staff",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cry of the Thunderhawk' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5310]={name="Sea Dog Britches",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Guns of Northwatch' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5311]={name="Buckled Boots",quality=2,ilvl=21,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free From the Hold' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Free From the Hold",lore="Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."},
    [5314]={name="Boar Hunter's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Consumed by Hatred' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Consumed by Hatred",lore="Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."},
    [5317]={name="Dry Moss Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Betrayal from Within' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Betrayal from Within",lore="Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",quality=1,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof (rare elite) in The Loch.",zone="The Loch",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5327]={name="Greasy Tinker's Pants",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Escape' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5340]={name="Cauldron Stirrer",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Apothecary Zamah'. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Apothecary Zamah",lore="I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5355]={name="Beastmaster's Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Isha Awak'. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5542]={name="Pearl-clasped Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5610]={name="Gustweald Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cave Mushrooms'. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Cave Mushrooms",lore="I am devising a potion that requires rare mushrooms, mushrooms that grow only in a certain cave. The cave lies behind Cliffspring Falls, to the east and slightly north along the mountains."},
    [5611]={name="Tear of Grief",quality=2,ilvl=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'For Love Eternal'. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="For Love Eternal",lore="In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5629]={name="Hammerfist Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
